  "_comment": "Maps catalog service names (per cloud) to resource types (the node data.resourceType join key) and a scope. scope='resource' guardrails attach to matching diagram nodes; scope='environment' guardrails are subscription/identity-level and are surfaced in a separate advisory group. Resource types are matched case-insensitively in app/services/guardrails.py. Several services intentionally share a resource type (e.g. App Service + Function App -> Microsoft.Web/sites); the matcher unions their guardrails and dedupes by control_id. The key name azure_resource_types is historical; AWS entries list CloudFormation types.",
